==English==

===Etymology===
A {{cal|en|es|momento de la verdad|nocap=1}}, which refers to the time of the final sword thrust in a [[bullfight]].

===Noun===
{{en-noun|moments of truth}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} A deciding instant; the time when a [[test]] determines or makes it apparent whether something will succeed.
#: ''The '''moment of truth''' comes when you try to start the engine you have just rebuilt.''

